invalid type: string "# Cough and cold\n\n## Matches\ncough, cold, runny nose, sneezing, chest congestion, phlegm, dry cough, wet cough, flu, khansi, zukaam, negadi\n\n## Questions\n1. How long have you had the cough or cold?\n2. Is the cough dry, or are you bringing up phlegm?\n3. Do you also have a fever or body ache?\n4. Is it getting better, worse, or staying the same?\n\n## Red flags\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ